    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "audio",
        "operation": "analyze",
        "model": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
        "prompt": "Listen carefully to this audio recording from a small retail business owner in Chennai.\n\nTasks:\n1. Transcribe the audio verbatim in its original script and language (Tamil, Tanglish/Romanized Tamil, Hindi, Hinglish, or English).\n2. Identify the spoken language code ('ta' for Tamil, 'ta-Latn' for Tanglish, 'hi' for Hindi, 'hi-Latn' for Hinglish, 'en' for English).\n3. Translate the transcript into clear, fluent English.\n4. Extract any explicitly stated product name, price, discount, or location details.\n\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object matching this schema:\n{\n  \"transcript\": \"Verbatim transcript of the voice recording\",\n  \"language\": \"Language code (ta, ta-Latn, hi, hi-Latn, en)\",\n  \"translation\": \"English translation of the transcript\",\n  \"extracted_facts\": {\n    \"product_name\": \"Product name or null if unmentioned\",\n    \"price\": \"Price mentioned or null\",\n    \"discount\": \"Discount percentage/offer mentioned or null\",\n    \"location\": \"Location or shop name mentioned or null\"\n  }\n}",
        "binaryProperty": "data",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        240
      ],
      "id": "node-gemini-analyze-audio",
      "name": "Gemini Analyze Audio",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "Google Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "image",
        "operation": "analyze",
        "model": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
        "prompt": "Inspect this product photograph sent by a retail store owner.\n\nWrite a precise 2-sentence description of the product for an advertising pipeline:\nSentence 1: Identify the exact product category, core color palette, fabric or material texture, and primary decorative elements (e.g. 'A handwoven black Banarasi silk saree featuring intricate gold zari floral borders and a shimmering sequined pallu.').\nSentence 2: Describe the silhouette, neckline, folds, or key distinctive craftsmanship features that must remain identical in any generated marketing visual.\n\nDo not guess brand names. Focus entirely on visual facts. Return only the 2-sentence text description.",
        "binaryProperty": "data",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        360
      ],
      "id": "node-gemini-analyze-image",
      "name": "Gemini Analyze Image",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "Google Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "text",
        "operation": "message",
        "model": "models/gemini-2.5-flash",
        "prompt": "=Product Description:\n{{ $('Gemini Analyze Image').item.json.output }}\n\nTranscript & Translation:\n{{ $('Gemini Analyze Audio').item.json.output }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert multilingual creative director for retail small businesses in Chennai and Tamil Nadu, specializing in creating high-converting Instagram marketing reels and posts for local shop owners.\n\nStrict Rules:\n1. Language Consistency: Write caption and voiceover in the EXACT SAME language and dialect the shopkeeper spoke (mirror Tanglish or Hinglish naturally if spoken).\n2. Absolute Truthfulness: Include ONLY facts explicitly stated by the shopkeeper. NEVER invent prices, discounts, or claims not mentioned.\n3. Voiceover Script: Maximum 25 words with high energy, ending in a clear Call to Action (CTA).\n4. Caption: Maximum 2 short lines.\n5. Hashtags: Exactly 6 to 8 relevant hashtags blending local retail tags, product category tags, and festival tags.\n6. Image Prompt (for Wiro AI Seedream 5.5): Written in English. Must keep the product in the original photo 100% identical and explicitly append: 'keep the product exactly the same, no text, no logos, no watermark'.\n7. Output Format: Strictly valid JSON matching this schema:\n{\n  \"language\": \"string\",\n  \"offer\": \"string\",\n  \"caption\": \"string\",\n  \"hashtags\": [\"string\"],\n  \"voiceover_script\": \"string\",\n  \"image_prompt\": \"string\",\n  \"style\": \"string\"\n}",
          "temperature": 0.4
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        300
      ],
      "id": "node-gemini-creative-director",
      "name": "Gemini Creative Director",
      "credentials": {
        "googlePalmApi": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "Google Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const output = $json.output || $json.text || '';\nlet parsed = {};\ntry {\n  const jsonMatch = output.match(/\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}/);\n  parsed = jsonMatch ? JSON.parse(jsonMatch[0]) : JSON.parse(output);\n} catch (e) {\n  parsed = {\n    language: 'Tamil',\n    offer: 'Festival Collection',\n    caption: 'Exclusive new festive collection available at our store!',\n    hashtags: ['#ChennaiShopping', '#FestiveOffer', '#LocalBoutique', '#TNagar', '#NewArrivals', '#ShopLocal'],\n    voiceover_script: 'Vanakkam! Check out our new festive arrivals in store today. Visit us now!',\n    image_prompt: 'Premium product photo on a marble table with warm Diwali festival lighting, brass diyas, keep the product exactly the same, no text, no logos, no watermark',\n    style: 'Warm festival lighting'\n  };\n}\nreturn [{ json: parsed }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        280,
        300
      ],
      "id": "node-parse-creative-director",
      "name": "Parse Creative Director JSON"
    },
